"earthengine-api або сервісного ключа GEE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY). Функція "
"вимкнена."
msgstr ""
"Google Earth Engine is not configured on this server (the earthengine-api"
" package or the GEE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY service key is missing). The "
"feature is disabled."

